(dup-traj)
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 a start on 1
*initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 mass=1
*segment 1 s
*when time=1 stop
*trajectory 1 b start on 1
*initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 mass=1
*segment 1 s
*when time=1 stop
*end
